{"4364520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robo", "steam_appid": 4364520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5065140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robo</strong> is a local multiplayer party action game for up to 8 players on a single computer, where robots are built and controlled in a completely unique way. You start with a single robot part, and the first button you press — on a keyboard or controller — is instantly assigned to it. Pick up another part, attach it to your robot, and the next button you press controls that part. Every robot becomes a custom control scheme shaped by your choices and reactions. At any moment you can respawn and reassign everything from scratch. Compete in fast-paced modes like races, combat arenas, and robot football, where chaos, creativity, and quick thinking matter more than memorizing controls.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robo</strong> is a local multiplayer party action game for up to 8 players on a single computer, where robots are built and controlled in a completely unique way. You start with a single robot part, and the first button you press — on a keyboard or controller — is instantly assigned to it. Pick up another part, attach it to your robot, and the next button you press controls that part. Every robot becomes a custom control scheme shaped by your choices and reactions. At any moment you can respawn and reassign everything from scratch. Compete in fast-paced modes like races, combat arenas, and robot football, where chaos, creativity, and quick thinking matter more than memorizing controls.</p>", "short_description": "Robo is a local multiplayer party action game where up to 8 players build robots on the fly and assign controls by simply pressing buttons, competing in fast-paced modes like races, combat, and robot football.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<